OL,5,MCARRINGTON ARRANGES NEW YUGOSLAV TRUCE
OL,7, 103FCeasefire valid from 1300 tomorrow
OL,8, 104FYugoslav jets violating it: Croatia
OL,9, 105FBlockade of Croat ports continues
OL,11, 109 COACH BOMBINGFWard case reopened
OL,12, 110FFollows release of Birmingham Six
OL,14, 111 ELECTIONFKinnock forecasts November
OL,15, 112FTories and Labour level in new poll
OL,17, 106 ISRAELFBaker offer on US loans row
OL,18, 107FPalestinians consider US assurances
OL,20, 114 ROVERFproposes new work practices
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG17-09-91
OL,23,D] FMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
