OL,1,Vk4                              G11/11
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGROVER PLANS NEW
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGWORKING PRACTICES
OL,5, Rover Cars has unveiled plans to
OL,6, introduce further Japanese-style
OL,7, working practices to its 35,000
OL,8, employees.
OL,10,FThe new proposals seek to remove shop-
OL,11,Ffloor demarcation and all distinctions
OL,12,Fbetween staff and hourly-paid workers.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FShop-floor workers will no longer have
OL,15,Fto clock on and there will be a single
OL,16,Fnegotiating body for trades unions.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe company said the scheme should also
OL,19,Fend any threat of workers being laid
OL,20,Foff without a choice; our employees
OL,21,Fmust feel secure, said a spokesman.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG17-09-91F  teletextarchive.com
